---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../site.config';
---
<BaseLayout title="关于我 / About" description={`关于 ${siteConfig.author}：一名在校学生，目前在杭州；喜欢有想象力的项目与开源。`}>
  <div data-pagefind-body>
    <header class="page-hero container about-hero">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span lang="en">COME SAY HI</span> · 关于我</span>
      <h1>你好呀，来认识<br />一下我吧。</h1>
      <p class="about-hero-en" lang="en">A few tiny notes about {siteConfig.romanizedName}.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="container about-grid personal-about-grid">
      <aside class="about-card personal-about-card">
        <div class="about-avatar about-avatar-han" aria-hidden="true">{siteConfig.profile.initial}</div>
        <h2>{siteConfig.author}</h2>
        <p lang="en">{siteConfig.romanizedName} · Pinyin</p>
        <dl class="profile-facts">
          <div><dt>身份 / <span lang="en">Role</span></dt><dd>{siteConfig.profile.role} · <span lang="en">{siteConfig.profile.roleEn}</span></dd></div>
          <div><dt>坐标 / <span lang="en">Base</span></dt><dd>{siteConfig.profile.location} · <span lang="en">Hangzhou</span></dd></div>
          <div><dt>相信 / <span lang="en">Belief</span></dt><dd lang="en">Open Source</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button" href={siteConfig.social.github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span lang="en">GitHub</span> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only">（新窗口打开）</span></a>
          <a class="button" lang="en" href={`mailto:${siteConfig.social.email}`}>Email</a>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <div class="about-content personal-about-content">
        <section class="about-story about-story-zh">
          <span class="language-label">中文 / ZH</span>
          <p>你好呀，我是徐丰俊，目前是一名在校学生，人在杭州。我喜欢有想象力的小项目，也一直坚定支持开源——很喜欢开源世界里分享与合作的感觉。</p>
          <p>比起把这里写成一本正经的简历，我更想把它当作一间小小的线上房间：放点关于我的碎片、喜欢的东西，以及能找到我的方式。</p>
          <p>开源是我很珍惜的事情——好点子一起分享，往往会长得更可爱。</p>
          <strong class="note-signoff">欢迎随便逛逛，喵～</strong>
        </section>

        <section class="about-story" lang="en">
          <span class="language-label">ENGLISH / EN</span>
          <p>Hi, I’m 徐丰俊 (Xu Fengjun in pinyin), a student currently in Hangzhou. I enjoy imaginative projects and strongly support open source, especially its spirit of sharing and collaboration.</p>
          <p>Rather than turning this place into a formal résumé, I’d like it to feel like a small room on the web: somewhere for a few pieces of me, things I enjoy, and ways to say hello.</p>
          <p>Open source matters to me — good ideas often grow into something lovelier when they’re shared.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>三枚小标签 <small lang="en">/ Tiny tags</small></h2>
          <div class="principles">
            <div class="principle principle-pink"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><strong>有趣的脑洞</strong><p lang="en">Imaginative little projects</p></div>
            <div class="principle principle-mint"><span aria-hidden="true">&lt;/&gt;</span><strong>开源与分享</strong><p lang="en">Open source and sharing</p></div>
            <div class="principle principle-lavender"><span aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><strong>杭州读书中</strong><p lang="en">Student life in Hangzhou</p></div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>保持联系 <small lang="en">/ Contact</small></h2>
          <p>我目前不求职，也不接单。不过想来敲敲门的话，可以通过 <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.social.email}`}>邮件</a>、<a href={siteConfig.social.github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span lang="en">GitHub</span><span class="sr-only">（新窗口打开）</span></a> 或 <a href={siteConfig.social.bilibili} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">哔哩哔哩<span class="sr-only">（新窗口打开）</span></a> 找到我。</p>
          <p lang="en">I’m not currently looking for work or taking commissions. You can still say hello by email, GitHub, or Bilibili.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
